There is a level where when you step onto it you get a
garbled message calling for help.  If you've wandered past
it without noticing, you can go back up, for each time you
return to that level you get a briefer version of the same
message.

Somewhere on that level is a magic portal, which, when you
step on it, transports you to the first level of your quest;
you want to be at least XP level 14 to go there, and in fact
the quest master / mistress will not accept you until you
are.

Once you find the portal and step through it, there is no
penalty for stepping off the other end, stepping back
through, and taking steps to assure that you are better
prepared before re-entering.

Be prepared for a fight!

